 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Nagata compactification over a Noetherian base",
 "statement": "The recursively constructed factorization\n$\\mathsf C_{\\mathrm{Noeth}}(X/S)$ is a compactification of $X\\to S$.\nConsequently $X\\to S$ is compactifiable.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-thm-nagata-sketch-noetherian/thm-nagata-noetherian.md",
